OL,3,GNEWSAEx-health minister calls for
OL,4,Amental health rethink
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former health minister who has long
OL,7,Fcampaigned on mental health issues, is
OL,8,Fcalling for a reform in the system.
OL,10,FNorman Lamb, represented North Norfolk
OL,11,Fas the Liberal Democrat MP from 2001 to
OL,12,F2019 and was appointed Minister of
OL,13,FState at the Department of Health in
OL,14,F2012.
OL,16,FHis new book, Be More Human: Why Mental
OL,17,FHealth Care Is Broken And What We Can
OL,18,FDo To Fix It, explores mental health
OL,19,Fservices in the UK and looks at
OL,20,Falternative and intervening measures to
OL,21,Ftreat people in crisis more kindly,
OL,22,Fwith humanity and dignity.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
